    {
      "bbox": [
        418,
        2382,
        1733,
        2591
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "For a first step, I would like you to appoint one of your executive assistants to represent you and serve as chairman for the drive among your employees. Please forward his name to Commissioner Badillo at the Department of Relocation by May 10, 1965.",
